{"abstract":[{"text":"A Hamiltonian path, or nil when there is none (or no vertex): the first one a depth-first","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"backtracking search finds, from each vertex in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order, extending through each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"incidentEdges","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in order to an unvisited vertex. Self-loops never help; one vertex is the trivial path. Pruning cuts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only subtrees with no solution (an unvisited vertex unreachable, or left with too few","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"usable neighbours), so it keeps the order. Without a start the search is run again from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each vertex in turn until one succeeds, so a graph with no Hamiltonian path costs n","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"searches.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Tours\/Hamiltonian.swift#L552","fileName":"Hamiltonian.swift"},"title":"hamiltonianPath()","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5ToursE15hamiltonianPath5Walks0E0Vy6VertexQz5Edges_5IndexQZGSgyF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"hamiltonianPath","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Path","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Walks4PathV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P